Author: claude (dev857 1dc6b323-8363-4e6c-94d5-43175b00a1d1) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 2 15:00:15 2026 -0400

    Initial dist-system-metadata package

    Distributed system metadata split out of tb-updater so fast-changing
    data (pinned Tor Browser versions, the Tor Project signing key) can
    migrate between suites independently of heavier code packages.

    - usr/share/dist-system-metadata/tb-updater/{tbb_hardcoded_version_stable,
      tbb_hardcoded_version_alpha,tbb-team.asc}
    - minimal Depends (${misc:Depends}) so it reaches stable on its own

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
